Description: R interface to the Python package 'critiplot' (v2.1.0),
    which creates publication-ready traffic-light plots and stacked bar
    charts for risk-of-bias assessments in systematic reviews and
    meta-analyses. Supports Newcastle-Ottawa Scale (NOS), JBI checklists
    (Case Report/Case Series), GRADE, ROBIS, and MMAT.
    This R wrapper uses 'reticulate' to call 'critiplot' from Python.
